# Every local certificate is generated, never shared: the keystore and the certificate only
# make sense next to the private key they were made with, so sharing the public half alone
# would just be overwritten by the next `certs/generate-local-cert.sh` run.
**/*-ssl.yaml
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.csr
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
